<p>
  All Northwest Arkansas Audubon Society field trips are free and open to the public.
  Membership is not required, though new members are always welcome. We try to make every trip
  accessible to all ages, abilities and interests, and beginning birders are always welcome.
</p>
<p>
  Trips are held on Saturdays and Sundays to fit different schedules. We encourage carpooling
  where possible. No pets, please.
</p>
